/Author (Wenxin Li) /CreationDate (D:20260502093900+00'00') /Creator (Wenxin Li) /Keywords (Coordination Knowledge Substrate, CKS, no-direct-channels, cell-to-cell communication, substrate-cell boundary, agent-framework agent-to-agent protocols, path retraceability, source-of-truth, conflict preservation, multi-cell coordination, human-governed AI systems, defensive publication) /ModDate (D:20260502093900+00'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (CKS derivation note A2.12: formalizes the architectural commitment that all cell-to-cell coordination state in the Coordination Knowledge Substrate pattern flows exclusively through the substrate, with no direct channels permitted between cells. Closes the substrate-cell-boundary decomposition \(A2.08-A2.12\).) /Title (Cell-to-Cell Communication Through the Substrate Only: The No-Direct-Channels Commitment in the Coordination Knowledge Substrate Pattern) /Trapped /False
